  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">World Bank ASTAE Givargemensam TF 2011-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank ASTAE Multi Donor Trust Fund 2011-2014 - WB ASTAE Multi Donor TF 11-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till V&#xe4;rldsbankens regionala givargemensamma fond &quot;Asia          Sustainable and Alternative Energy Program (ASTAE)&quot; med 40 million    SEK mellan &#xe5;ren 2012-2015. TF st&#xf6;djer alternativa energik&#xe4;llor och    effektiv energianv&#xe4;ndning i V&#xe4;rldsbankens utl&#xe5;ning. Det &#xf6;vergripande  m&#xe5;let med programmet &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka tillg&#xe5;ngen p&#xe5; modern energi f&#xf6;r       m&#xe4;nniskor i fattigdom samt att skydda milj&#xf6;n.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank Multi donor TF to scale up the use of sustainable energy   solutionsin Asia. Promotion of three pillars: Renewable Energy,       Energy Efficiency and Access to Energy, through:Innovative delivery   mechanisms, Enhance policy abd regulatory frameworks, Capacity        building and share knowledge, Introduce new technologies or           mainstream proven tech., Mitigation and adaptation to climate change</narrative>
  </description>
